ically review the updated content against the implemented behavior so\n52\t  claims in the conformance statement match what was actually built.\n53\t- Out of scope: conformance claims for flows or capabilities outside the four\n54\t  audited ones, and screen-reader conformance beyond what the keyboard fixes\n55\t  establish.\n56\t\n57\t## Acceptance Criteria\n58\t\n59\t- Given the completed keyboard accessibility remediation of the four audited\n60\t  flows, When the VPAT is updated, Then its conformance claims for those flows\n61\t  reflect the fixed state and cite the implemented behavior accurately.\n62\t- Given the completed remediation, When the product docs accessibility\n63\t  statement is updated, Then it reflects the fixed state of the audited flows.\n64\t- Given the updated conformance content, When it is reviewed, Then a technical\n65\t  review against the implementation confirms accuracy before publication\n66\t  (required by HLR-3).\n67\t- Given the reviewed content, When publication completes, Then the updated VPAT\n68\t  and accessibility statement are publicly available to customers (the\n69\t  renewal-blocking deliverable).\n70\t\n71\t## HLR Traceability\n72\t\n73\t- HLR-3 (P2): The accessibility conformance documentation (VPAT and product\n74\t  docs accessibility statement) is updated and republished to reflect the fixed\n75\t  state, with technical review — covered by all acceptance criteria above.\n76\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-aa03c5c6ea1e7688","agent_id":"ac4a693267a7c428e","session_id":"5475345a-5695-4c0a-a45f-922c8c9f46be","uuid":"379521ea-9122-48bc-878c-e2a302526aa2","timestamp":"2026-10-21T16:08:07.463Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-90c74544ad136153","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9017 decomposition"}
